libproc-waitstat-perl (1.00-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Take over for the Debian Perl Group; Closes: #862645 -- RFA/ITA
  * debian/control: Added: Vcs-Git field (source stanza); Vcs-Browser
    field (source stanza); Homepage field (source stanza). Changed:
    Maintainer set to Debian Perl Group <pkg-perl-
    maintainers@lists.alioth.debian.org> (was: Roderick Schertler
    <roderick@argon.org>).
  * Replace (build-)dependency on ancient version of perl with a dependency on
    perl without a version (as permitted by Debian Policy 3.8.3).
  * debian/watch: use metacpan-based URL.
  * Mark package as autopkgtest-able.
  * Declare compliance with Debian Policy 4.0.0.
  * Switch to source format "3.0 (quilt)".
  * Simplify debian/rules.
  * Don't install README anymore.
  * debian/copyright: switch formatting to Copyright-Format 1.0.
  * Add /me to Uploaders.
  * Improve short and long description.

 -- gregor herrmann <gregoa@debian.org>  Fri, 04 Aug 2017 12:01:11 -0400

